{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"詩篇","commonName":"詩篇","title":"詩篇","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"459b5a4b12b2ca0929884c296e82479f990b5c49c76874f4a699afa4e3d9e703","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2449},"chapter":{"number":39,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["受苦者的呼求"]},{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["大衛的詩，交給樂長耶杜頓。"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"我說：「我要謹言慎行，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"免犯口舌之罪。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"只要身邊有惡人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我就用嚼環勒住自己的口。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"然而，我默不作聲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"連好話也不出口時，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"內心就更加痛苦。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我心如火燒，越沉思越煩躁，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"便開口呼求：","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「耶和華啊，求你讓我知道我人生的終點和壽數，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"明白人生何其短暫。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你使我的生命轉瞬即逝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的歲月在你眼中不到片刻。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人的生命不過是一絲氣息，（細拉）","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人生不過是幻影，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"勞碌奔波卻一場空，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"積蓄財富卻不知誰來享用。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主啊，如今我等候什麼呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你是我的盼望。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你救我脫離一切過犯，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要讓愚昧人嘲笑我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我默然不語，一言不發，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我受的責罰是出於你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你不要再懲罰我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的責打使我幾乎喪命。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為人犯罪，你責罰管教他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如同蛀蟲吞噬他們所愛的。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"世人不過是一絲氣息。（細拉）","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"「耶和華啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你垂聽我的禱告，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"傾聽我的呼求，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"別對我的眼淚無動於衷。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我在你面前只是客旅，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是寄居的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"正如我的祖先。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你寬恕我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好讓我在離世之前能重展笑容。」","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/39.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/40.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/38.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}